WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.500
Okay.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.720
So there is a new poll released yesterday
which shows Bernie Sanders ahead of President

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:11.550
Donald Trump by nine percentage points in
a hypothetical 2020 matchup and Joe Biden

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:18.390
ahead of Trump by 10 percentage points in
a similar hypothetical 2020 matchup.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:23.880
This if even slightly accurate, is incredible,
but we've got some caveats.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:29.599
The first caveat, which will be very clear
to many in our audience is that a Fox News

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:33.480
poll is the source of this information and
I know that that will immediately make many

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.260
people on the left not trusted.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:41.391
The funny thing is that very same fact that
it is a Fox News poll is making a lot of the

00:00:41.391 --> 00:00:47.370
American right wing very nervous because they
tend to trust Fox News and they're now stuck

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:52.750
in a cognitively dissonant spot between a
rock and a hard place, so to speak.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:58.039
The truth is that every one of these poles
has a margin of error and the Fox News poll

00:00:58.039 --> 00:01:02.430
is not drastically out of line with what other
polls are finding.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:06.270
Although, yes, the leads, the deficits that
Donald Trump has according to this latest

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:08.560
poll are bigger than in most other polls.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.280
You have to remember that at this point there
are also lots of undecided, so the plus 10

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:20.270
that Biden has in the plus nine that Bernie
has, a lot of that is because there are people

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:26.509
who have not yet decided, many of whom, many
of whom will eventually break for the incumbent.

00:01:26.509 --> 00:01:30.170
So if anybody thinks that Donald Trump is
going to lose the popular vote by 10 percentage

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:35.170
points in November of 2020, uh, that is extraordinarily
unlikely to happen.

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:39.420
Uh, and remember that we are still 500 days
from the election and these are only hypothetical

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:44.170
matchups because we don't actually know who
is going to be running against Donald Trump

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.500
as the winner of the Democratic primary.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:52.970
This will all start to get more representative
of what we can expect in November of 2020.

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:58.719
Once the democratic debates begin, once all
of those one and two percenters start to drop

00:01:58.719 --> 00:02:05.470
out, and that support starts to shift to other
Democratic candidates when Trump starts campaigning.

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:08.160
There's a lot here that is going to happen
soon.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.700
And I want to mention something else that's
funny.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:12.660
Along these lines, I saw a discussion on a
subreddit.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:17.180
I'm not even going to tell you which sub reddit
because I don't want to give it any publicity.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:23.080
This poll showing Trump down so bigly to Biden
and to, to uh, uh, Bernie Sanders.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:28.610
It's sort of pierced the echo chamber because
when it came out they came up with an amazing

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.480
post hoc rationalization.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:35.360
I want to try to explain it clearly because
I really you to understand what it is that

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.920
they are trying to say in response to this
pole.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:39.950
It's just so wacky.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:48.569
The reaction was Fox News faked the poll results
because Fox News wants Biden to win and the

00:02:48.569 --> 00:02:53.580
reason Fox News once Biden to win is that
Fox News is right wing.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.959
They want war with Iran.

00:02:55.959 --> 00:02:59.620
Trump now says he doesn't want war with Iran.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.690
Joe Biden will go to war with Iran.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:10.599
So now the pro war right wing propaganda apparatus
wants Biden to defeat Trump so that Biden

00:03:10.599 --> 00:03:15.810
will take us to a big war with Iran, which
is why Fox News has decided to turn on Trump

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:18.630
and foe publish fake polls that show Biden
winning.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:24.360
Now, aside from the fact that that entire
conspiracy theory is not based in any fact,

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:29.620
uh, there's another thing here which is that
it's not clear to me that polls showing someone

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.739
is winning when they're not winning.

00:03:31.739 --> 00:03:32.739
Help them to win.

00:03:32.739 --> 00:03:38.360
In other words, if you don't want Biden to
win and you see a poll saying he defeat Trump,

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:43.159
doesn't that make you more likely to go and
support Trump so that the pole doesn't become

00:03:43.159 --> 00:03:44.159
a reality?

00:03:44.159 --> 00:03:49.040
Like maybe, I don't even understand how fake
polling is designed to work, but on every

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.680
level that post-hoc rash rationalization makes
no sense.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:58.690
What's clear is that as of right now, Donald
Trump does have a problem how big of a problem

00:03:58.690 --> 00:03:59.690
it is.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:03.500
We won't know until the debates tart and until
Donald Trump starts actually campaigning in

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:03.510
earnest.

